{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M758Q8RACMR047"}],"opens":"Debts the readings of the ninth session found across the whole wiki, older than it: where the entry is named, said four ways; the names map said both let go and still held; an object model still listing an index where the store has a table; links by section number, as [§8], which the wiki itself says broke; Relations' never a copy beside a holon kept in each store that holds it; dense paragraphs in A mount is a call and Moving is a new address; What is open repeating Relations' own open list; the formats survey, Prose held by lone links and Why not an interior, perhaps to be sunk as history or sources; words used before they are given, as lexicon, buffer and field as a key. A whole-wiki round, the whole read and written again, not patched.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M758Q8RACMR048","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The wiki read whole under the rule","prev":null}
{"body":{"kept":"Whole in the author's words: every utterance as it came, typed or spoken, the session's reading which; words the dictation misheard corrected on the word, with what it wrote kept. After each, the essence of the session's answer in its own voice, the fuller answers written in the conversation and not kept. The work stands in bea76b5, a set checked as a set, and 008dd38, a fact asked once for all its bindings, a store's level by pattern from 466 to about 155 ms; in the wiki's rewrite for what was settled; and in the store's own commits. OpenLight's specs were read from a fresh clone, its engine, chassis, bootstrap, pilot and horizon, and the rule from its own repository. It began on 2026-11-10 and ran into 2026-11-11; a session has one day, as the thread Where a date belongs leaves it.","on":"2026-11-10","paths":[{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93J"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93K"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93M"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93N"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93P"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX93Q"},{"$ref":"1M758Q8RACMR048"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX024"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX04P"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX05G"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX072"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX07X"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX09Q"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0AR"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0CT"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0FQ"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0JW"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0NH"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0QG"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX0YP"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX11Z"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX16W"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX18F"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX19P"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX1AN"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX1HN"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX1M8"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX1W5"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX1Y2"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX2BS"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX2DR"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX31Z"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX34G"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX3EG"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX3GK"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX3ME"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX3NV"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX3PQ"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX475"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX487"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX4GF"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQWEBX4H5"},{"$ref":"1M757SXQ